  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5202.11 On-call personnel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5202.11 “On-call personnel” means personnel trained in firefighting or hazardous material or waste response, or both that are not on duty at the time of the incident but are called in by the incident commander to assist with the response.\n\nSource. #12614-A, eff 8-23-18",
